import Standards.NIST.SHA1
import Sha1.Spec.Hasher
import Sha1.Spec.Program

/-!
# `sha1` specification

Entry point for the specification of the `sha1` crate:

* `Standards.NIST.SHA1`: the SHA-1 hash algorithm of FIPS 180-4;
* `Sha1.Spec.Hasher`: the bytes in memory of the `[u32; 5]` hash value `block_api::compress`
  reads and overwrites;
* `Sha1.Spec.Program.Extracted`: the compiled program, generated by `scripts/extract.py`;
* `Sha1.Spec.Program`: call semantics of the eight extracted entry points (valid calls, the
  slice tables, the output reader, and the preserved registers); the machine environment a call
  assumes is lean-x86's.

`Sha1.Statements` may import only specification modules.
-/
